<title>JAPAN: Japan July-Sept GDP to be announced on Tuesday-EPA.</title>
<headline>Japan July-Sept GDP to be announced on Tuesday-EPA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Economic Planning Agency (EPA) said on Friday that it would announce Japan's gross domestic product (GDP) data for the July-September quarter at 3.30 p.m. (0630 GMT) next Tuesday.</p>
</text>
